			"widgets_values":[
				"## Exact source-audio path\n\n1. The same **Load Audio** output feeds MiniMax **ref_audio_0** and **VRGDG MiniMax H3 Audio Drive**.\n2. Prompt with the exact tags: <Picture 1> and <Audio 1> (for example: <Picture 1> sings and lip-syncs exactly to <Audio 1>).\n3. The purple node locks the encoded audio latent while the sampler generates video.\n4. Its **original_audio** output goes directly to every final video combine node. H3's decoded/generated audio is intentionally not used.\n5. Keep the Duration value matched to the selected audio clip. Video Combine has **trim_to_audio** enabled as a final safeguard."
